        "content": "# WF2 — JARVIS Brain Router v4\n## AGI-Grade Multi-Task Parallel Dispatch\n\n### Architecture Pattern: Fan-Out / Scatter-Gather\n\n```\nMessage → Decompose Intents (LLM)\n         ↓\n   [{agent, task, priority, gating}]\n         ↓\n   Parallel dispatch → WF3x (all needed agents)\n         ↓\n   Collect responses → Synthesize → Return\n```\n\n### Key upgrades vs v3:\n1. **Multi-intent decomposition** — 1 message → N agents in parallel\n2. **Structured JSON output** — no brittle string parsing\n3. **Task decomposition** — each agent gets tailored sub-task\n4. **Priority routing** — primary agent responds first\n5. **Complexity scoring** — simple=1 agent, complex=fan-out\n6. **Crisis escalation** — always wf3b + flag\n7. **Context injection** — persona shapes routing decisions\n\n### Fallback chain:\n- user OR key + claude-haiku-4-5 (paid)\n- 402/429 → user OR key + llama-3.3-70b:free\n- no user key → system OR key + llama-3.3-70b:free",
