        "content": "## Multi-Task Response Strategy\n\n**Single agent (most cases):**\nReturn WF3x response directly\n\n**Multi-agent (fan-out):**\nDispatch all in parallel via Promise.all\nPrimary agent response = main answer\nSecondary agents = supplemental data\nSynthesizer merges into unified response\n\n**Priority levels:**\n- P1: primary intent (answer this)\n- P2: secondary (enrich response)\n- P3: background (fire-and-forget async)\n\n**Examples:**\n\"เครียดเรื่องงาน ช่วย search tips ด้วย\"\n→ P1: wf3b (emotional support)\n→ P2: wf3d (search stress relief tips)\n\n\"log อาหาร + อยากฟังเพลง\"\n→ P1: wf3g (log food)\n→ P2: wf3f (play music) async",
